{"results":[{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/runwal-the-residence","title":"Runwal The Residence In Malabar Hill | Buy 2, 3 & 4 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Malabar Hill](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-1a256b7a209)\n\n>\n\nRunwal Developers\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-developers-runwal-the-residence-elevation-1678787960.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-developers-runwal-the-residence-elevation-1678788074.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-developers-runwal-the-residence-elevation-1678788163.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-developers-runwal-the-residence-bedroom-1678788175.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/runwal-developers-runwal-the-residence-swimming-pool-1678788093.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/241024024654-runwal-logo-1.webp)\n\n# Runwal The Residence\n\nRunwal The Residence, Kilachand House, 91, Nepean Sea Rd, Near, Vasant Vihar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n₹19.2 Cr - 29.25 Cr\n\n₹19.2 Cr - 29.25 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nRunwal The Residence is thoughtfully designed by the renowned Runwal Developers. It is a residential project situated in Malabar Hill. It is an out-of-the-ordinary Residential development in Malabar Hill, which offers a great serenity for variant people living there. The project offers a perfect combination of modern Apartments along with high-standard contemporary interior fittings. Runwal The Residence is the leading 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and also 4 BHK Apartment. The project is located near schools, colleges, hospitals, shopping malls, grocery stores, and restaurants.\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2020\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹1,35,211/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n1420 - 2163 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Access to important landmarks.\n* Panoramic view of the sea.\n* Schools, hospitals, educational institutes, restaurants, banks, and a movie theatre are all nearby.\n\n* Strategically constructed homes.\n* For a comfortable living environment, there are landscaped gardens, a swimming pool, a tree plantation, and a children's play area.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nResident Sentiment: Most residents express satisfaction with the high-end living experience and the prestige associated with the Malabar Hill address. Neighborhood Atmosphere: Reviewers frequently highlight the serene, quiet, and green environment which is a rare find in South Mumbai. Safety and Security: Online feedback consistently mentions the presence of regular police patrolling and a general sense of safety within the locality. Connectivity: Residents appreciate the proximity to elite schools, hospitals, and the central business districts of South Mumbai.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nPrime Location\n\nThe project is situated in one of India's most exclusive neighborhoods, providing a status-symbol address.\n\nSerene Environment\n\nThe surrounding area offers a peaceful atmosphere with significantly less noise compared to other parts of the city.\n\nHigh-End Amenities\n\nResidents benefit from premium facilities including a modern gymnasium, multiple sports courts, and well-maintained leisure spaces.\n\nNatural Light and Ventilation\n\nArchitectural reviews and owner feedback suggest that the units are well-designed to maximize cross-ventilation and sunlight.\n\nReliable Utilities\n\nThe area is noted for having a consistent 24/7 water supply and minimal to no power outages.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nPedestrian Accessibility\n\nSome reviews point out a lack of adequate footpaths in the immediate vicinity, making it difficult for residents to walk outside the gates.\n\nDistance from Rail\n\nThe nearest metro and railway stations are a significant distance away, making the project heavily dependent on private transport.\n\nHigh Cost of Living\n\nBeyond the property price, the daily cost of goods and services in the Malabar Hill area is significantly higher than the city average.\n\nLimited Social Vibe\n\nThe neighborhood is described as quiet and sometimes \"deserted\" at night, which may not appeal to those seeking a vibrant nightlife.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nUltimate luxury status\n\nIdeal for legacy families\n\nHigh-tier privacy\n\nRare green sanctuary\n\nSteep entry price\n\nCar-dependent lifestyle\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/eco-friendly-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/eco-friendly-secondary.svg)\n\nEco Friendly\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary.svg)\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-secondary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/eco-friendly-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/eco-friendly-primary.svg)\n\nEco Friendly\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary.svg)\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-primary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/walking-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-primary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-primary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK\n\n3 BHK\n\n4 BHK\n\n* ## 1420 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n2 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹19.20 Cr\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/runwal-developers-runwal-the-residence-2-bhk-bedroom-1678789502.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![bank-primary](/assets/icons/bank-primary.sv