is the price range of Runwal The Residence?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Runwal The Residence is ₹19.2 Cr - 29.25 Cr\n\n### Where is Runwal The Residence located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nRunwal The Residence is located at Runwal The Residence, Kilachand House, 91, Nepean Sea Rd, Near, Vasant Vihar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006.\n\n### What configurations are available in Runwal The Residence?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nRunwal The Residence has 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Runwal The Residence?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Runwal The Residence is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Runwal The Residence?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are Eco Friendly, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Multipurpose Hall, Senior citizen Area, Swimming Pool, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Runwal The Residence?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Runwal The Residence is Runwal Developers.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Runwal The Residence:Runwal Developers](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/241024024654-runwal-logo-1.webp)\n\n## Runwal Developers\n\nEstablished in 1978, Runwal Developers has emerged as a revered and trusted real estate entity in Mumbai. With a remarkable portfolio encompassing residential, commercial, and organized retail ventures, the company is synonymous with unwavering dedication to quality, service, and punctuality. Beyond crafting dream residences, Runwal Developers aspires to curate lifestyles that infuse genuine joy and contentment into the lives of its patrons. The company boasts a track record of delivering prestigious projects, many of which have earned accolades and captured the hearts of satisfied customers.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/anchor-daewoo-industries-anchor-south-ridge-elevation-1714635669.webp)\n\n![Anchor South Ridge](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/020524124927-newproject-2024-05-02t124915257.webp)\n\nAnchor South Ridge\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹11.23 Cr\n\n3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vinod-jain-developer-vinod-36-babulnath-elevation-1688543205.webp)\n\n![Vinod 36 Babulnath](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/050723124954-newproject-2023-07-05t124859366.webp)\n\nVinod 36 Babulnath\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹7.75 Cr - 10 Cr\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/fair-deal-infrastructure-fairdeal-ocean-360-elevation-1684411458.webp)\n\n![Fairdeal Ocean 360](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/180523051706-newproject-2023-05-18t171335344.webp)\n\nFairdeal Ocean 360\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.21 Cr - 5.77 Cr\n\n1, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![arrow-left-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-left-swiper.svg)\n\n![arrow-right-swiper](/assets/icons/arrow-right-swiper.svg)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Lodha_Group-Lodha_Seamont--Bedroom-1651748559.webp)\n\n![Lodha Seamont](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/171121063046-Lodha.png)\n\nLodha Seamont\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary]