structure-1a256b7a209b13a3230)\n* [Runwal Developers projects in Malabar Hill , Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-runwal-developers-1a256b7a209b13a15)\n* [Lodha Group projects in Malabar Hill , Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-lodha-group-1a256b7a209b13a32)\n* [Group Satellite projects in Malabar Hill , Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-group-satellite-1a256b7a209b13a19)\n* [Anchor Daewoo Industries projects in Malabar Hill , Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-anchor-daewoo-industries-1a256b7a209b13a6492)\n* [Vinod Jain Developer projects in Malabar Hill , Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-vinod-jain-developer-1a256b7a209b13a4216)\n\n## Property by configuration in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n* [1 BHK in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/1-bhk-malabar-hill-1a256b3a4b7a209)\n* [2 BHK in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/2-bhk-malabar-hill-1a256b3a5b7a209)\n* [3 BHK in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/3-bhk-malabar-hill-1a256b3a6b7a209)\n* [4 BHK in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/4-bhk-malabar-hill-1a256b3a7b7a209)\n* [5 BHK in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/5-bhk-malabar-hill-1a256b3a12b7a209)\n\n## Property by budget in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n* [Properties between 0 - 25 Cr in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-25crores-1a256b7a209b9a2500)\n* [Properties between 0 - 50 Cr in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-50crores-1a256b7a209b9a5000)\n* [Properties between 10 Cr - 25 Cr in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-10crores-25crores-1a256b7a209b8a1000b9a2500)\n* [Properties between 25 Cr - 50 Cr in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/malabar-hill-25crores-50crores-1a256b7a209b8a2500b9a5000)\n\n## Projects by construction status in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n* [Ready to move properties in Malabar Hill](https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/ready-to-move-malabar-hill-1a256b6a2b7a209)\n\n[![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)](/)\n\n### OVERVIEW\n\n* [About Us](/about)\n*