n\n![Lodha Altamount residential project in Altamount Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/lodha-altamount-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nAltamount Road, Mumbai\n\n3, 4, 5 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 17.46 Cr to 40.40 Cr\n\n![Kalpataru Parag residential project in Peddar Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-parag-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Tata Petit Towers residential project in Peddar Road](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/tata-petit-towers-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 16.49 Cr\n\n## Resale Listings in Runwal Malabar\n\nExplore resale listings currently available in Runwal Malabar, Mumbai.\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Runwal Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai]()\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK Apartment For Sale in Runwal Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai]()\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Riya Realty  profile picture]()\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Runwal Malabar\n\n### How many residences are planned in Runwal Malabar?\n\nRunwal Malabar includes only around 10 residences, making it a low-density luxury project.\n\n### Does Runwal Malabar offer sea-facing homes?\n\nYes. Selected residences at Runwal Malabar are planned to feature 270° panoramic views of the Arabian Sea and the skyline.\n\n### What configurations are available in Runwal Malabar?\n\nRunwal Malabar offers luxury residences with 3, 5 BHK options.\n\n### Does Runwal Malabar have private elevator access?\n\nYes. Runwal Malabar includes private elevator access planning for residences. It also has private floor parking for the safety and convenience of the residents.\n\n### When is possession expected at Runwal Malabar?\n\nRunwal Malabar is currently in the New Launch stage. The possession is expected around Jun 2032.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://soboxpert.com/runwal-malabar-hill","title":"Runwal Malabar Hill | Floor Plan, Photos, Amenities & More","raw_content":"![](https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=1273422231520507&ev=PageView&noscript=1)\n![Logo](/Logo1.png)\n![Luxury residential real estate project](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/1773748753_runwal_malabar_hill_photo.jpg)\n\n# Iconic Sea View Residences in Runwal Malabar\n\nPalatial 3 & 5 BHK homes from from ₹26.49 Cr\\*\nin Malabar Hill\n\n## Ultra Luxury Living at Malabar Hill\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill is an ultra-premium residential development located in the elite Malabar Hill neighborhood of Central Mumbai. This exclusive new launch spans across a land parcel of approximately 0.5 acres, offering boutique luxury living. The project features spacious 3 & 5 BHK residences designed for refined urban lifestyles. A single iconic tower rises up to G+31 storeys, delivering panoramic views of the Arabian Sea and city skyline. Crafted with modern architecture and premium finishes, every home ensures privacy and sophistication. Expected possession by June 2032, Runwal Malabar Hill sets a new benchmark for luxury living in South Mumbai.\n\n![runwal malabar hill Luxury residential real estate project](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/1773751201_runwal_malabar_hill_photo.jpg)\n\n## The Residences\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill 3 BHK Simplex Floor Plan](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/floor_plans/1773751201_4bhk.png)\n\n### 3 BHK Simplex\n\nCarpet Area: 2400 Sq.Ft\n\n₹ 26.49 Cr\\*\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill 5 BHK Duplex Floor Plan](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/floor_plans/1773751201_5bhk.png)\n\n### 5 BHK Duplex\n\nCarpet Area: 4900 Sq.Ft\n\nOn Request\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill Penthouse Floor Plan](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/floor_plans/1773751201_6bhk.png)\n\n### Penthouse\n\nCarpet Area: On Request\n\nOn Request\n\n## Experience World Class Amenities\n\n![runwal malabar hill amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/amenities/1773751201_Zumba___Aerobics.webp)\n\nZumba & Aerobics\n\n![runwal malabar hill amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/amenities/1773751201_Cr__che.webp)\n\nCrèche\n\n![runwal malabar hill amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/amenities/1773751201_Amphitheatre.webp)\n\nAmphitheatre\n\n![runwal malabar hill amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/amenities/1773751201_Indoor_Games_.webp)\n\nIndoor Games'\n\n![runwal malabar hill amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/amenities/1773751201_Kids_Play_Area.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![runwal malabar hill amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/amenities/1773751201_Sunken_Sit-out_Area.webp)\n\nSunken Sit-out Area\n\n![runwal malabar hill amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/amenities/1773751201_Swimming_Pool.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![runwal malabar hill amenities](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/amenities/1773751201_Podium_Area.webp)\n\nPodium Area\n\n## Project Gallery\n\nExplore premium residential spaces through curated visuals.\n\n![runwal malabar hill photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/gallery/1773751201_runwal_malabar_hill_photo_6.webp)\n![runwal malabar hill photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/gallery/1773751201_runwal_malabar_hill_photo_5.webp)\n![runwal malabar hill photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/gallery/1773751201_runwal_malabar_hill_photo_4.jpg)\n![runwal malabar hill photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/gallery/1773751201_runwal_malabar_hill_photo_3.jpg)\n![runwal malabar hill photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/gallery/1773751201_runwal_malabar_hill_photo_2.jpg)\n![runwal malabar hill photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/gallery/1773751201_runwal_malabar_hill_photo_1.jpg)\n![runwal malabar hill photos](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/gallery/1773751201_runwal_malabar_hill_photo.jpg)\n\n## Unmatched Connectivity Malabar Hill\n\nMarine Drive\n\n6 minutes drive\n\nKamala Nehru Park\n\n5 mins drive\n\nHanging Gardens\n\n5 mins drive\n\nThe Malabar Hill Club\n\n4 mins drive\n\nLower Parel\n\n19 mins drive\n\nHanging Garden\n\n5 mins drive\n\nBanganga Tank\n\n700 meters\n\nMalabar Hill Elevated Nature Trail\n\n4 mins drive\n\nNana Nani Park\n\n6 mins drive\n\nWilson College\n\n6 mins drive\n\n### Get Directions & Site Visit\n\nFill the form to unlock exclusive offers & floor plans.\n\n## We Promise\n\n#### Instant Call Back\n\nOur sales experts are online to assist you\nimmediately.\n\n#### Free Site Visit\n\nComplimentary pick-up & drop service for site\nvisits.\n\n#### Unmatched Price\n\nBest market rates guaranteed directly from the\ndeveloper.\n\n## About Runwal Realty\n\nRunwal Realty, part of the trusted Runwal Group, is a leading real estate developer in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region (MMR) with a legacy dating back to 1978. The brand is known for premium residential projects, modern townships and landmark retail spaces like R City Mall. With 17,000+ homes delivered across Mumbai, Thane, Andheri and Chembur, Runwal focuses on quality construction, innovative design and timely delivery. Their key developments — Runwal One, Runwal Rare and Runwal Lands End — reflect their commitment to crafting lifestyle-rich, future-ready communities. Runwal Realty remains a top choice for homebuyers seeking reliable and luxury living in Mumbai.\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill Developer Logo](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/1773751201_Runwal_Realty_Logo.png)\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n# Home Loan EMI Calculator\n\nPlan your future home with precision. Get instant breakdowns of your monthly payments and interest costs.\n\n## Loan Summary\n\n### Amortization Schedule\n\n| Year | Opening Balance | Interest Paid | Principal Paid | Closing Balance |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n\n#### Detailed Amortization\n\nView the full year-by-year principal and interest breakdown to plan your repayment strategy.\n\n### Frequently Asked Questions\n\n## MahaRERA Registration\n\n![RERA QR for Runwal Malabar Hill](https://soboxpert.in/PropertiesImages/runwal-malabar-hill/maharera/1773751282_runwal_malabar_hill_RERA_Number_PR1170002502441.png)\n\n#### Runwal Malabar Hill\n\nPR1170002502441\n\nDetails available on the website [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in) under registered projects.\n\n# Luxury Properties\n\nCurated Collections in Malabar Hill\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill](https://soboxpert.in/images/1773747478_runwal_malabar_hill_photo.jpg)\n\n### Runwal Malabar Hill\n\n\"Runwal Malabar Hill | Floor Plan, Photos, Amenities & More\"\n\n![Dhuleva 7](https://soboxpert.in/images/1773481268_dhuleva_7_photo.jpg)\n\n### Dhuleva 7\n\n\"Dhuleva 7 Malabar Hill Mumbai – Price, Floor Plans & Booking\"\n\n![Birla Anayu](https://soboxpert.in/images/1769776262_download__27_.jpg)\n\n### Birla Anayu\n\n\"Birla Anayu Malabar Hill – Sea View Luxury Residences\"\n\n![Lodha Malabar](https://soboxpert.in/images/1777714010_lodha_malabar_photos.webp)\n\n### Lodha Malabar\n\n\"Lodha Malabar Hill | Book 4 & 5 BHK Sea View Homes @ ₹65 Cr\\*\"\n\n### Request Details\n\nInquiring about\n\n## Properties in Mumbai\n\nExplore premium projects by category\n\n### 